{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c65b2ef8bddec30e0ee22e13c6020330d4c0c8184301ea3981532830caf3f878", "ja": "センターの育は、はりきってレッスンの\n進行役も引き受ける。だがプロデューサーに\n「大人もみんなに助けてもらっている」と\n仲間に頼る事の大切さをアドバイスされ、\n自分もみんなと一緒に頑張る事を決める。", "zh": "担任Center的育干劲十足，\n同时接下了带领练习课程的职责。\n但制作人表示「大人同样会寻求他人帮助」，\n提醒了她依靠伙伴的重要性，\n而育自己也决定和大家一同努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "e45876d803140f5fbc484820fd6d704370ea1eed9c48e7f8edd6e711b6a16f58", "ja": "みんな、今日はありがとう！\n楽しんでもらえた？　えへへ！", "zh": "各位观众，今天真的很谢谢大家！\n看得还开心吗？嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1001_se", "source_sha256": "d879f355605ef90703e4475dd838606af8a121050feb943ccb8c8eebe061e212", "ja": "わあああああー！！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "8f343a18b3a455d197bf52d3fb0ec727667c8882188b60a6f4413ec8a1bb1153", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ただいま！\nわたし、ちゃんとできてたよね！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我回来了！\n我表现得很棒吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7222df5af1e4d32927cf7bfcd89fb2255a91b17698b8139b49f8449862b166bb", "ja": "ああ、ばっちりだったぞ！\n育は初めてのセンター、どうだった？", "zh": "是啊，完美无缺喔！\n育，首次Center的感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "84f4287a3bfa81291361bfac84680a1fe50ada1798357ee19562cb20bdccea75", "ja": "うん！\nあのね、すっ……ごく楽しかった！！", "zh": "嗯！\n我觉得，非──常开心喔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "922da9db14bcde031366eb35e61d33265164afd48f7a3fea6fbac8bbac807463", "ja": "わたしが思いっきり手を振ったら、お客さんたち、\nいっぱい手を振り返してくれたよ！", "zh": "我在台上用力挥手，\n台下的观众也都用力对我挥手呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "ab220d99c05cae632b038c2f269403074cbcdab8ded8829cd4c803563fdc616c", "ja": "会場中が、キラキラしてたんだけども……それに\n負けないくらい、育ちゃんがキラキラして見えたべさ。", "zh": "整个会场都闪闪发亮……但是小育也不逊色，\n看起来非常闪亮哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "860e1cafccd7de43fa170197f9b2ee068636cf1bc3bf5ce5f56397d2fe8b5e33", "ja": "うんうん！　スポットライトが当たった時なんて、\nまるで『シャイニー☆アイドル』みたいだったよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！聚光灯照到你身上时，\n简直就像是『闪耀☆偶像』一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "ef9ba07b5d4f18363a626b4b0e7d5837cdcf2983c0645dee0f850fc6f9bc8dc1", "ja": "ほんと！？\nわたし、シャイドルみたいになれてた？", "zh": "真的吗！？\n我变得像是闪偶一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "15a6163c67a5c606f3df8ed7ce72b63b783ad9fa08d5d9e5e1ddef28478affc9", "ja": "むしろ、シャイドルちゃん以上ですっ！　ありさは、\nアイドルちゃんの無限の可能性を感じました……！", "zh": "甚至可说是超越了闪偶啊！\n亚利沙感受到偶像宝贝无限的可能性了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "cf1ded2d9599bfe05e68f5fb39bb38c608f6f1e0c77367a00ccde20b2e561bf6", "ja": "育さんがごヒイキ様方に素敵な魔法をかけられたのも、\nきっと練習の成果だと思いますよ♪", "zh": "小育能为主顾们施展这么美妙的魔法，\n肯定也是练习的成果♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "41abee5eebbbaf4d0fcfc4a4c93319ac416fc755c54cc72bfdb40c07c77df25f", "ja": "えへへ……みんな、ありがとう！\nわたしがキラキラできたのは、みんなのおかげだよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢大家！\n我能够闪闪发亮，都要感谢大家帮忙喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1012_p", "source_sha256": "93c99a8fb2b71962a3c38a6429a71fa1c4d76cf3af273171f72ab2315cbc901f", "ja": "そうだな。みんなで力を合わせてきたから、\n今日の成功があるんだ。みんな、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "是啊，因为大家同心协力，\n才会有今天的成功。各位，真的辛苦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
