{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "ab4509c04740c3f90d2188f0c1f41c3b8d6e93995bf7a334f0fad2b8918af7f9", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　公演も無事\n終わったことですし、今日はこれから打ち上げに……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！公演顺利结束了，\n今天就接着举办庆功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
