{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "3fc32caca177988f335f58eff614601f61680ec4dbd5742f23c5d9d938e13f48", "ja": "……は、できないみたいだね。\n育ちゃん、大丈夫？　眠いのかな？", "zh": "……看来是办不成了呢。\n小育，你还好吗？想睡了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "96234554da46fac59b2b0e3eba4c3da74a3cd916050d024e1a403260d6492ab8", "ja": "うん……大丈夫だよ、美奈子さん……。\nふわぁ……。", "zh": "嗯……我没事喔，美奈子姊姊……\n呼哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7a9fa83dfa35e0fa5a65b815c58ea0bc413f2b48b8768cfc9d7a2ae7da98e2df", "ja": "はは……今までの練習の疲れが出たんだな。\n今日はみんな、早く帰ってちゃんと休む事にしよう。", "zh": "哈哈……之前那些练习的疲劳都浮现出来了吧。\n今天大家还是早点回去休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "b194da2dc921aa289aa586a5ddf9f95948d736fea60b48f8049b32f351088f42", "ja": "打ち上げはまた今度ですね……うう、初センター後の\n育ちゃんのオフショットが撮れないとは、無念……。", "zh": "下次再找时间举办庆功宴吧……呜呜，\n无法拍到小育首次Center过后的休闲照，遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "b48b88dff4ff41614f1fdeff01316f71c74b21c27e4c5fc70d2a4060b642271b", "ja": "亜利沙さん、そんなに落ち込まなくても……。\n果報は寝て待て、と言いますから。", "zh": "亚利沙，不需要这么沮丧的……\n俗话说有福之人不用忙呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "a11891d48bc24fd0e98ae5bd00b176188e69d653367fb25511e501b55d049134", "ja": "打ち上げ、良かったらうちにしませんか？\nとびっきりのご馳走、用意しておきますよ♪", "zh": "大家不介意的话，要不要来我家店里举办庆功宴？\n我会准备非常美味的大餐喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "215c1e61fa6fd16ef5dcd1002919e0efd08cd71a8f87948086d6118f17e335bb", "ja": "わあ、美奈子さんのお店かい？\nならあたしも、何か持っていくよぉ。", "zh": "哇，美奈子家开的店吗？\n那我也带点东西过去吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0d795315a8ebb39b7ae321d14a499de7fb3184c6963face2e1136b838dae35c7", "ja": "それじゃ、みんな着替えにいってこい！\n俺はその間、後片付けをしておくから。", "zh": "好，那大家先去换衣服！\n我会趁这段时间收拾会场的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "656a6107140c556f87a58110a14dd2289f3c7de63ade7f5fc54ce3b8b7e980ad", "ja": "うん……{$P$}さん、\nありがとう……。", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}先生，\n谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
