{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "95efed3ae3805f5c21b7c76271938126c212a6c0a8b182b9ac0bd13562401c74", "ja": "あっ、いたいた！\n{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "啊！原来你在这里！\n{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5289c008b2566443cad6c09e9aef2c7485cab04fa78da7a475d1382c9c5fd1df", "ja": "育？　どうしたんだ？\nさっきまであんなに眠そうだったのに……。", "zh": "育，怎么了？\n你刚才看起来不是还很困吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "3d6704012b0363ebbe240ec97512d4d80592896b607112bb3d7d49bad1bfc30d", "ja": "あのね、おかあさんが楽屋に来てたの！\n{$P$}さんに、あいさつしたいって！", "zh": "那个啊，刚刚妈妈来休息室找我了！\n她说想和{$P$}先生打声招呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1033_p", "source_sha256": "aed0c7d08ef8cb84b126111e4524beabf3108489a0bd33d0dd98e374258a3b26", "ja": "育のお母さんが？\nそっか、それは挨拶しないとだな！", "zh": "育的妈妈啊？\n这样啊，那我得快去打招呼才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "5f93ca13c21dd738706fd7035669f77d91c6c776ca4e89ea74d72bb6361d75a6", "ja": "うん！　だから、いっしょに来て！\n早く早く♪", "zh": "嗯！那就跟我一起来吧！\n快点快点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_031_1035_p", "source_sha256": "2530af116d24415e5769f77cdb0f098fbcd1ef0011be4feb268b9fdcf26f6c17", "ja": "（アイドルの顔とは少し違う、年相応にあどけない、\nはじける笑顔……。でも、輝きは同じくらいかな！）", "zh": "（育的表情不太像是偶像，是她这年纪该有的\n天真灿烂笑容……不过，散发出来的光辉都是一样的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
